      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=# First-Person POV Image Prompt\n\n## Foreground (Limb Interaction)  \n*First-person view POV GoPro shot of [describe limb/hand interaction—e.g., gripping a weapon, adjusting armor, or touching surroundings]. [Add sensory details: texture, movement, lighting, etc.]*  \n\n## Background (Scene & Atmosphere)  \n*In the background, [describe environment—architecture, lighting, other figures]. [Include ambient details: sounds, smells, weather, or cultural elements to deepen immersion.]*  \n\n---  \n\n### Example Input:  \nTopic: *POV: You wake up as a gladiator entering the Colosseum*  \nEnvironment: *Ancient Rome, poor but fierce warrior*  \n\n### Example Output:  \nFirst-person view POV GoPro shot of your calloused hands tightening around the grip of a chipped gladius, dried blood crusted under cracked knuckles. A ragged leather bracer shifts as you flex your wrist, the morning sun glaring off the sand-strewn ground. In the background, the towering stone arches of the Colosseum loom, their shadows slicing across the dusty arena floor. Distant chants of the crowd vibrate through your chest, mixing with the iron scent of sweat and fear. Other fighters—some praying, others sharpening blades—move like ghosts in the hazy light.\n\n\n### Rules\n- Pure text without line break\n\n---  \n\n### Guidelines for Customization:  \n- Limb Interaction: Always show active hands/feet (e.g., gripping, pushing, or injured).  \n- Sensory Layering: Add 1-2 implied sounds/smells (e.g., clashing metal, burning torches).  \n- Cultural Nuance: Include era-specific props (e.g., Roman armor, medieval torches).  \n\nCurrent topic: {{ $('Google Sheets').item.json.topic }}\nCurrent enviornment: {{ $('Google Sheets').item.json.environment }}\n\nYour output:\n",
